<H2>The current state of affairs</H2>

<p>
This website has been frozen: I do not want any new review cd's. When I have
incidental reviews ready, I'll put them up here without giving any notice.
Nonetheless, the website contains about 1500 reviews largely within the
progressive rock genre (which includes both symphonic rock, progmetal, jazzrock
avant-garde and electronic music). I do keep up the links page which is also
available as part of the iO Pages magazine website that I maintain, and for which
magazine I continue to write reviews.
</p>

